57                C_VAR:  Variable in M_DS with change-from-baseline data, such as CHG.
58                LO_VAR: Variable in M_DS with LOWER LIMIT of reference range, such as ANRLO.
59                        Required to highlight values outside reference range (RED DOT in box plot), and reference lines
60                HI_VAR: Variable in M_DS with UPPER LIMIT of reference range, such as ANRHI.
